WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:05.670
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

01:25.290 --> 01:29.960
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

01:33.670 --> 01:38.340
<b>The true way to use a real sword
is not by stabbing forcefully.</b>

01:38.430 --> 01:41.810
<b>It's much like using
a kitchen knife or a saw.</b>

01:44.020 --> 01:48.900
<b>The blade cuts the best when it is pulled.</b>

01:49.730 --> 01:51.060
<b>To cut as you retreat.</b>

01:51.900 --> 01:55.280
<b>Don't you think it's the best technique
for an elusive person like you?</b>

01:55.860 --> 01:59.490
<b>But I couldn't take a life
with this method.</b>

01:59.570 --> 02:01.700
<b>At most, I could cut hide or meat.</b>

02:02.490 --> 02:03.580
<b>That's okay.</b>

02:04.080 --> 02:06.870
<b>That's precisely what makes it
the Elusive Sword.</b>

02:12.460 --> 02:14.880
<b>Your raised left hand
will serve as a guide.</b>

02:15.510 --> 02:21.430
<b>Wait for the moment when your enemy's
blade passes between your hand and sword.</b>

02:23.760 --> 02:25.140
<b>Here he comes!</b>

02:25.220 --> 02:26.810
<b><i>Twist my upper body counterclockwise.</i></b>

02:27.600 --> 02:30.150
<b><i>Let the weight of the sword</i>
<i>do the work as I lower it.</i></b>

02:30.770 --> 02:32.270
<b><i>Pull the blade to the right</i></b>

02:32.360 --> 02:33.900
<b><i>and retreat!</i></b>

02:41.870 --> 02:43.700
<b>My inner forearm.</b>

02:43.780 --> 02:46.870
<b>I don't have any armor here
because it's a difficult spot to aim for,</b>

02:46.950 --> 02:49.790
<b>and it impedes my movement.</b>

02:50.290 --> 02:54.210
<b>You know the weak points
of an armored warrior well.</b>

02:54.290 --> 02:57.170
<b>But it's not a terrible weakness.</b>

02:57.800 --> 03:02.470
<b>It'll take quite some time for me to lose
consciousness with just a bleeding wrist.</b>

03:03.050 --> 03:08.680
<b>You think I won't kill you
before that happens?</b>

03:10.310 --> 03:13.860
<b>In this small room!</b>

03:15.690 --> 03:20.360
<b>I'll corner you slow and steady.</b>

03:20.450 --> 03:24.370
<b>I can just take my time to tend
to my wound after I cut you into pieces.</b>

03:34.130 --> 03:36.670
<b><i>Why did I shiver just now?</i></b>

03:42.430 --> 03:44.050
<b><i>He's a naginata expert.</i></b>

03:44.640 --> 03:46.640
<b><i>He won't let me get a single blow in!</i></b>

03:57.860 --> 03:59.280
<b>You're light, small,</b>

03:59.860 --> 04:02.450
<b>and lack experience!</b>

04:09.410 --> 04:11.290
<b>You two will die here.</b>

04:11.870 --> 04:13.870
<b>What a shame.</b>

04:13.960 --> 04:16.960
<b>In ten years, you probably would have
become a skilled master.</b>

04:17.710 --> 04:21.090
<b>If that were the case,
you could have known many pleasures.</b>

04:21.920 --> 04:26.260
<b>The sophisticated pleasure of using your
body and strength to kick about the weak,</b>

04:26.760 --> 04:30.770
<b>the pleasure of stealing,
the pleasure of taking a woman…</b>

04:31.730 --> 04:35.940
<b>That's what my boss taught me
when he took me under his wing.</b>

04:36.440 --> 04:42.110
<b>Something your virtuous leader
Yorishige Suwa can't do.</b>

04:45.200 --> 04:47.200
<b>Lord Yorishige isn't…</b>

04:47.280 --> 04:48.370
<b>Huh?</b>

04:49.200 --> 04:51.290
<b>…our lord now.</b>

04:52.700 --> 04:53.830
<b>Is that so?</b>

04:53.910 --> 04:55.870
<b>Regardless of who you serve,
it's all the same.</b>

04:55.960 --> 04:58.000
<b>Your lord is clueless.</b>

04:58.090 --> 05:00.880
<b>They couldn't even teach you brats
about any fulfilling pleasures</b>

05:00.960 --> 05:04.760
<b>and left you to die
for this worthless village.</b>

05:07.340 --> 05:08.600
<b>So you shut up.</b>

05:08.680 --> 05:09.680
<b>Am I spot-on?</b>

05:10.510 --> 05:12.140
<b>Yeah, it's true.</b>

05:12.220 --> 05:16.730
<b>Our lord is soft, naive,
and tends to run away.</b>

05:19.110 --> 05:24.740
<b>But compared to you who has grown fat
by sacrificing the weak, my Big Brother,</b>

05:24.820 --> 05:30.240
<b>who commands us to protect the weak,
has much more integrity as a warrior.</b>

05:31.330 --> 05:32.950
<b>You're still here?</b>

05:33.040 --> 05:36.420
<b>Resisting with a brat's toy
like the trash you are!</b>

05:38.210 --> 05:39.590
<b>Persistent brat.</b>

05:39.670 --> 05:43.710
<b>There's no way a mere child can penetrate
the defense of a grown man's naginata.</b>

05:48.970 --> 05:50.300
<b>Stop calling me</b>

05:51.930 --> 05:53.560
<b>a brat!</b>

05:57.980 --> 06:01.480
<b>I can't be so carefree
to be thinking about the far future.</b>

06:01.570 --> 06:05.110
<b><i>We have a year and a half</i>
<i>until Lord Yorishige's prophecy.</i></b>

06:05.190 --> 06:09.110
<b><i>We won't be useful</i>
<i>in the Young Lord's great war</i></b>

06:09.200 --> 06:11.490
<b><i>if we can't beat adults while we're ten.</i></b>

06:12.450 --> 06:13.740
<b>What…</b>

06:19.500 --> 06:23.840
<b>I can't believe I'm being defeated
by some nameless brats.</b>

06:24.800 --> 06:27.050
<b>Go be with the demons in hell.</b>

06:27.630 --> 06:30.050
<b>Our lord is Tokiyuki Hojo.</b>

06:30.140 --> 06:31.300
<b>What?</b>

06:31.390 --> 06:32.640
<b>Kamakura's…</b>

06:35.220 --> 06:37.640
<b>rightful heir!</b>

06:41.770 --> 06:45.440
<b><i>There's no way!</i></b>

07:00.000 --> 07:01.040
<b><i>I can't hit him!</i></b>

07:12.390 --> 07:13.470
<b><i>This is bad.</i></b>

07:13.550 --> 07:16.180
<b><i>I have to stop the bleeding.</i></b>

07:43.790 --> 07:47.590
<b><i>He's not only evading my sword,</i>
<i>but also my splattering blood?</i></b>

07:48.380 --> 07:50.760
<b><i>Is he a monster?</i></b>

07:59.180 --> 08:01.060
<b><i>A transforming swordsmanship!</i></b>

08:07.150 --> 08:10.820
<b>It's rare to see one wield a blade
with such precision.</b>

08:11.490 --> 08:13.990
<b>There must be someone
who taught you those techniques.</b>

08:14.620 --> 08:15.660
<b>Who is your teacher?</b>

08:16.240 --> 08:18.450
<b>I don't have to tell you.</b>

08:19.040 --> 08:22.330
<b>A skilled hawk hides everything.</b>

08:22.960 --> 08:26.170
<b>If you show your strength
within an organization,</b>

08:26.250 --> 08:31.050
<b>you'll be taken advantage of
like the small fry and the core members.</b>

08:31.550 --> 08:34.260
<b>Act like a clown and pander to the leader,</b>

08:34.340 --> 08:37.140
<b>and you can be sure to enjoy
just the benefits.</b>

08:37.220 --> 08:38.140
<b>BUDDHA</b>

08:38.220 --> 08:41.140
<b>There is just one brief moment
when I have to use my sharpened talons.</b>

08:41.230 --> 08:44.850
<b>The moment when I kill anyone
that recognizes them.</b>

08:45.650 --> 08:49.020
<b>Or when I kill our boss
and take over this party.</b>

08:49.980 --> 08:52.530
<b>To hide yourself is an art of survival
in times of chaos!</b>

08:53.530 --> 08:57.280
<b>Now die and shut up!</b>

09:01.200 --> 09:02.540
<b><i>To hide… huh.</i></b>

09:04.460 --> 09:07.420
<b>Die!</b>

09:08.250 --> 09:10.340
<b><i>There's an ordinary blade</i>
<i>that comes straight,</i></b>

09:10.920 --> 09:13.300
<b><i>and a unique blade</i>
<i>in which one bends their wrist.</i></b>

09:13.840 --> 09:17.930
<b><i>If you hide it well, your opponent won't</i>
<i>know which is coming until it's too late.</i></b>

09:18.510 --> 09:20.720
<b><i>But with him, the height of his elbow is</i></b>

09:20.810 --> 09:23.680
<b><i>slightly different</i>
<i>from the moment he pulls back his blade.</i></b>

09:23.770 --> 09:26.810
<b><i>Which means he's not</i>
<i>sufficiently hiding his technique.</i></b>

09:28.150 --> 09:29.310
<b>W-What?</b>

09:34.950 --> 09:37.820
<b>That would be a formidable sword skill
if you could hide it completely,</b>

09:37.910 --> 09:40.830
<b>but you don't understand how it works.</b>

09:43.750 --> 09:46.670
<b>You're not hiding anything special
as I thought.</b>

09:47.880 --> 09:49.080
<b>I'm disappointed.</b>

09:58.890 --> 10:01.970
<b><i>He wields two swords</i>
<i>and is skilled in martial arts, too.</i></b>

10:02.060 --> 10:06.270
<b><i>What else is this kid hiding?</i></b>

10:08.900 --> 10:14.110
<b><i>Occupying this village and</i>
<i>the children's tactics are both valuable.</i></b>

10:15.070 --> 10:17.820
<b><i>When I find a hidden treasure,</i></b>

10:18.820 --> 10:22.950
<b><i>my forlorn body</i>
<i>is slightly brought back to life.</i></b>

10:25.660 --> 10:27.660
<b><i>I'm drawn to him for some reason.</i></b>

10:28.210 --> 10:32.290
<b><i>Because he's hiding something magnificent.</i></b>

10:42.680 --> 10:45.180
<b>All right. That's enough from you.</b>

10:52.520 --> 10:53.860
<b><i>Now.</i></b>

10:53.940 --> 10:57.690
<b><i>How is it going, Chojumaru?</i></b>

11:24.970 --> 11:26.520
<b><i>This is hopeless.</i></b>

11:26.600 --> 11:28.520
<b><i>I'm going to die.</i></b>

11:28.600 --> 11:32.100
<b><i>I'll lose too much blood</i>
<i>before I kill this kid.</i></b>

11:32.600 --> 11:35.520
<b><i>It's useless. I'm fading.</i></b>

11:35.610 --> 11:40.070
<b><i>My life ends here?</i></b>

11:40.950 --> 11:42.200
<b>Father!</b>

11:42.280 --> 11:46.030
<b>What do you mean
there's no territory for me to inherit?</b>

11:47.830 --> 11:49.160
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:49.830 --> 11:53.880
<b>The family has distributed the land
amongst the sons</b>

11:54.880 --> 11:57.880
<b>over generations until
only this small plot remains.</b>

11:58.630 --> 12:00.630
<b>From now on, like all the other families,</b>

12:00.720 --> 12:02.930
<b>we'll give all our territory
to the eldest son.</b>

12:03.430 --> 12:07.640
<b>You live here and help out
your older brother.</b>

12:08.720 --> 12:11.890
<b>You're telling me
to become my brother's servant!</b>

12:23.910 --> 12:26.910
<b><i>I've been studying martial arts</i>
<i>and the art of war</i></b>

12:26.990 --> 12:29.370
<b><i>so that I can protect my own territory!</i></b>

12:30.370 --> 12:34.670
<b><i>A warrior without a territory</i>
<i>is not a warrior at all.</i></b>

12:43.880 --> 12:48.930
<b><i>If I wanted a place of my own,</i>
<i>I had no choice but to steal it.</i></b>

12:54.190 --> 12:57.440
<b><i>It was hell from then on.</i></b>

12:58.190 --> 13:01.440
<b><i>Somewhere along the way,</i>
<i>it became pleasurable to take from others.</i></b>

13:01.940 --> 13:03.110
<b><i>I sold children.</i></b>

13:03.200 --> 13:07.700
<b><i>I felt better about myself by sending them</i>
<i>to futures as dark as my own.</i></b>

13:08.450 --> 13:11.200
<b><i>Though I was pursued,</i>
<i>I had nowhere to rest.</i></b>

13:11.290 --> 13:15.210
<b><i>I thought I could reverse my fate</i>
<i>when I was recruited into a large battle.</i></b>

13:15.290 --> 13:17.170
<b><i>But I was unable to</i>
<i>make a name for myself,</i></b>

13:17.250 --> 13:18.710
<b><i>for I was on the losing side.</i></b>

13:24.590 --> 13:28.350
<b>Your life is always hell, isn't it?</b>

13:28.970 --> 13:31.890
<b>You should flee somewhere
where no one can chase you.</b>

13:32.560 --> 13:36.310
<b>There must be a place
where the light shines.</b>

13:38.650 --> 13:41.820
<b><i>Don't lie, Kusunoki.</i></b>

13:42.530 --> 13:46.110
<b><i>There's no light anywhere.</i></b>

13:50.780 --> 13:51.990
<b><i>What's this?</i></b>

13:52.080 --> 13:55.830
<b><i>Something shines before me.</i></b>

14:07.630 --> 14:09.850
<b><i>I can't win.</i></b>

14:10.600 --> 14:15.810
<b><i>Someone who can laugh so purely</i>
<i>in this hellhole cannot be human.</i></b>

14:18.650 --> 14:22.320
<b><i>He's even smiling upon someone like me?</i></b>

14:24.940 --> 14:27.700
<b><i>My Buddha…</i></b>

14:38.080 --> 14:40.750
<b><i>What started as a blade</i>
<i>of compassion had become</i></b>

14:41.840 --> 14:46.170
<b><i>hell on earth</i>
<i>by the time the fight was over.</i></b>

14:47.880 --> 14:50.680
<b><i>Is it a demon or a buddha that grants</i></b>

14:51.350 --> 14:54.060
<b><i>the scoundrel of times of chaos</i>
<i>the death penalty?</i></b>

14:57.560 --> 14:59.560
<b><i>Demon-heart Buddha Blade.</i></b>

15:04.150 --> 15:06.530
<b>You're amazing, Young Lord.</b>

15:06.610 --> 15:10.200
<b>The two of us barely stood a chance
against that monster.</b>

15:10.280 --> 15:13.160
<b>It's all thanks
to the technique Fubuki taught me.</b>

15:13.240 --> 15:14.370
<b>You're right.</b>

15:14.450 --> 15:16.620
<b>Who would have thought
that it would be possible to defeat him</b>

15:16.700 --> 15:18.620
<b>by simply cutting his inner forearm
and running from him?</b>

15:18.710 --> 15:20.250
<b>The Cowardly Sword is impressive!</b>

15:20.330 --> 15:21.540
<b>Don't call it that!</b>

15:22.210 --> 15:24.090
<b>The enemies that remain should run away</b>

15:24.170 --> 15:26.340
<b>when we spread the word
that their general is dead.</b>

15:26.420 --> 15:28.010
<b>We're almost done…</b>

15:33.390 --> 15:34.390
<b>Are you serious?</b>

15:34.470 --> 15:36.060
<b>Sadamune's here!</b>

15:37.720 --> 15:41.020
<b>You again, brat?</b>

15:43.520 --> 15:45.940
<b>"You again"? That's our line!</b>

15:46.020 --> 15:48.650
<b>You're the one invading others' territory!</b>

15:48.740 --> 15:50.820
<b>Shut up! These are the times we live in!</b>

15:50.900 --> 15:54.280
<b>Your eye… I want to feed it to a snake
and watch it swallow it whole.</b>

15:54.370 --> 15:56.580
<b>-What's wrong with you?
-What's wrong with you?</b>

15:56.660 --> 15:58.660
<b>Big-Eyed Monster, you're so persistent.</b>

15:58.750 --> 16:00.330
<b>Don't call me a monster!</b>

16:00.410 --> 16:02.420
<b>You basically are a monster
with those eyes!</b>

16:02.500 --> 16:03.830
<b>What did you say about my godly eyes?</b>

16:03.920 --> 16:06.710
<b><i>Leave it to Sadamune Ogasawara</i>
<i>to bring his reinforcements at this timing</i></b>

16:06.800 --> 16:10.920
<b><i>from the village's front entrance.</i>
<i>He's got a keen perception of this war.</i></b>

16:11.590 --> 16:15.260
<b><i>Our other allies are busy handling</i>
<i>the enemies that are already here.</i></b>

16:15.850 --> 16:17.430
<b><i>We can't win like this.</i></b>

16:17.510 --> 16:18.350
<b>SOUTH</b>

16:18.430 --> 16:20.520
<b><i>There are no enemies</i>
<i>on the south end of this village.</i></b>

16:20.600 --> 16:23.310
<b><i>We can gather our allies</i>
<i>and all escape from there…</i></b>

16:25.190 --> 16:26.320
<b>What?</b>

16:27.020 --> 16:28.570
<b>Enemy forces from the south, too?</b>

16:29.650 --> 16:30.940
<b>Nope.</b>

16:32.400 --> 16:33.490
<b>Here we go!</b>

16:36.620 --> 16:38.120
<b>That fire!</b>

16:40.950 --> 16:43.870
<b>Yes, they're reinforcements
from Suwa Grand Shrine.</b>

16:44.540 --> 16:46.130
<b>They made it just in time.</b>

16:46.710 --> 16:47.630
<b>Drat!</b>

16:48.210 --> 16:49.170
<b>Retreat!</b>

16:49.250 --> 16:52.300
<b>Only gather Shokan's soldiers
that are fighting nearby.</b>

16:52.380 --> 16:54.430
<b>B-But, Sadamune…</b>

16:54.510 --> 16:58.140
<b>We lack the preparation
to fight against Suwa's main army.</b>

17:04.230 --> 17:08.900
<b><i>The war is happening outside, but there's</i>
<i>blood on the inside of the door?</i></b>

17:08.980 --> 17:13.110
<b>Lord Yorishige, Sadamune
and his presumed army are evacuating!</b>

17:13.200 --> 17:15.110
<b>Chase them away to the border.</b>

17:15.200 --> 17:17.280
<b>Tokitsugu, clean up the bandits
around the village.</b>

17:17.370 --> 17:18.370
<b>YORISHIGE'S SON
TOKITSUGU SUWA</b>

17:18.450 --> 17:19.740
<b>Okay.</b>

17:21.120 --> 17:23.370
<b>-They're getting away.
-Hi.</b>

17:23.460 --> 17:24.540
<b>Genba!</b>

17:24.620 --> 17:25.960
<b>You better be grateful.</b>

17:26.580 --> 17:29.750
<b>We made it in time
because I rode the horse at full speed.</b>

17:30.250 --> 17:33.670
<b>Well, when I saw
a curvy woman on the road,</b>

17:34.170 --> 17:37.180
<b>I was shocked because
my nose started bleeding profusely.</b>

17:37.260 --> 17:38.640
<b>I thought I was a goner.</b>

17:38.720 --> 17:40.850
<b>Don't die!</b>

17:40.930 --> 17:42.600
<b>-What about over there?
-There's no one.</b>

17:42.680 --> 17:43.890
<b>-The enemy's over there.
-Right.</b>

17:44.690 --> 17:47.810
<b>None here. Find them!</b>

17:49.110 --> 17:50.570
<b>Mr. Yorishige.</b>

17:56.200 --> 17:57.990
<b>I'm glad you're safe.</b>

18:00.240 --> 18:01.240
<b>Yes.</b>

18:04.660 --> 18:08.210
<b>That kinda hurts, Mr. Yorishige.</b>

18:20.720 --> 18:22.560
<b>Sadamune. Shokan is…</b>

18:22.640 --> 18:25.230
<b>He's got dumb luck.</b>

18:25.730 --> 18:29.190
<b>He would've croaked if we stopped
the bleeding just a little bit later.</b>

18:29.690 --> 18:32.940
<b>Why did you come for me?</b>

18:33.440 --> 18:37.780
<b>We received word that you and your men
were wasting time committing a massacre.</b>

18:37.860 --> 18:42.200
<b>Suwa's response isn't so stupid as
to let such an opportunity go unnoticed.</b>

18:43.040 --> 18:45.580
<b>Who said to kill the villagers?</b>

18:45.660 --> 18:48.830
<b>You don't get any taxes
from an uninhabited territory.</b>

18:48.920 --> 18:50.670
<b>You idiot.</b>

18:51.590 --> 18:53.840
<b>Punish me as you wish.</b>

18:53.920 --> 18:59.340
<b>However, your strategic insight
this time was incredible.</b>

18:59.930 --> 19:03.760
<b>I will give you a small territory,
so sharpen your fangs there.</b>

19:03.850 --> 19:07.350
<b>Prepare for the decisive battle
against Suwa that will eventually come.</b>

19:07.430 --> 19:10.400
<b>From this day forward,
you are prohibited from being a bandit.</b>

19:10.480 --> 19:13.730
<b>Serve me only as a soldier.</b>

19:26.040 --> 19:27.040
<b>Certainly.</b>

19:28.790 --> 19:31.290
<b><i>I can tell his will to be a bandit</i>
<i>is gone from his eyes.</i></b>

19:31.380 --> 19:33.790
<b><i>Did malice leave his body</i>
<i>along with the blood?</i></b>

19:36.460 --> 19:39.720
<b><i>From then on,</i>
<i>rogues gradually fell under the control</i></b>

19:39.800 --> 19:43.800
<b><i>of the increasingly powerful governing</i>
<i>feudal lords and eventually disappeared.</i></b>

19:45.060 --> 19:49.180
<b><i>This era was the final stage</i></b>

19:50.230 --> 19:52.770
<b><i>where the uninhibited</i>
<i>bandit samurai thrived.</i></b>

19:54.820 --> 19:56.440
<b>There.</b>

19:56.530 --> 19:59.570
<b>There we go.</b>

19:59.650 --> 20:00.650
<b>Mr. Yorishige.</b>

20:01.280 --> 20:06.080
<b>It's all thanks to Fubuki
that the village and I survived.</b>

20:06.910 --> 20:09.960
<b>Please pay him a special sum
from Suwa Grand Shrine.</b>

20:11.290 --> 20:13.250
<b>Oh, is that so?</b>

20:13.330 --> 20:15.920
<b>Of course, we will pay him handsomely!</b>

20:16.000 --> 20:17.210
<b>And one more thing.</b>

20:17.300 --> 20:20.670
<b>I want Fubuki to join my party
as a retainer.</b>

20:20.760 --> 20:21.840
<b>Splendid idea!</b>

20:22.970 --> 20:24.930
<b>Wait, Chojumaru.</b>

20:25.010 --> 20:28.850
<b>I want to be your friend, but becoming
a retainer is a different story.</b>

20:28.930 --> 20:32.140
<b>I want to serve a lord
that can lead the country.</b>

20:32.230 --> 20:34.980
<b>I would consider it
if I were to serve your Lord Suwa…</b>

20:36.980 --> 20:38.900
<b>This one</b>

20:39.990 --> 20:41.400
<b>is the lord.</b>

20:42.110 --> 20:43.160
<b>This one.</b>

20:44.740 --> 20:46.370
<b>My name is Tokiyuki Hojo.</b>

20:46.450 --> 20:49.450
<b>I'm the orphan of the regent
to the Kamakura shogunate, Takatoki Hojo.</b>

20:49.540 --> 20:51.910
<b>I am more or less on an endeavor
to lead the country.</b>

20:53.500 --> 20:55.420
<b>What?</b>

20:57.170 --> 20:58.710
<b>Sorry I hid it from you.</b>

20:58.800 --> 21:00.960
<b>I had decided
to not share my true identity</b>

21:01.050 --> 21:03.090
<b>until I had talked to Mr. Yorishige.</b>

21:03.180 --> 21:06.930
<b><i>I thought he was hiding</i>
<i>something huge, but…</i></b>

21:09.220 --> 21:11.230
<b><i>This secret is too big!</i></b>

21:12.350 --> 21:15.940
<b><i>As a commoner,</i>
<i>he's just a kind, elusive boy.</i></b>

21:16.020 --> 21:19.320
<b><i>But when you add the fact</i>
<i>that he is a Hojo child…</i></b>

21:20.150 --> 21:24.030
<b><i>All of his skills</i>
<i>become formidable weapons!</i></b>

21:27.280 --> 21:29.120
<b><i>This is invigorating.</i></b>

21:32.250 --> 21:34.460
<b>My millet fee will be expensive.</b>

21:35.120 --> 21:37.210
<b>If that's okay, then I will serve you.</b>

21:46.340 --> 21:49.850
<b><i>I will draw out</i>
<i>all the strength this prince possesses</i></b>

21:49.930 --> 21:51.930
<b><i>and join his attempt to win the country.</i></b>

21:52.890 --> 21:56.770
<b>At Suwa Grand Shrine, we're allowed to
eat rice instead of millet.</b>

21:56.850 --> 21:58.980
<b>For real? It must be paradise?</b>

21:59.060 --> 22:02.690
<b>I can't tell
if this guy is smart or clueless.</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.870
<b>TO BE CONTINUED</b>
